Constraints.Constraint:
File layout, all under
docs/plans/active/RM-GOVERNED-PATH/:
decisions.md (markdown stub only);
decisions.xml (citation index, root
RecordIndex);
findings.xml (live finding bodies, root
Findings);
findings-retired.xml (root Findings);
rulings.xml (live decision bodies; not named
decisions.xml; root Rulings);
rulings-retired.xml (root Rulings);
registry.xml (live registry, source of truth,
root Registry);
registry-retired.xml (root Registry);
record-inventory.json (preservation inventory
of pre-split heading tokens, assigned ids,
and whitespace-normalized decoded body hashes,
written from the frozen file at execution).
No other new path under docs/plans/.
docs/plans/archive/ is not written.
D28 genres (findings / decisions / registry)
and D31 layers (index / live / retired) are
two triples; do not conflate them.
